y":"## Feature\r\n\r\nWhen you see the `collections` module,  there are two versions of `collections.OrderedDict`, pure Python implementation and implemented in CPython C code.\r\n\r\nTo check compatibility, run the below lines:\r\n\r\n```python\r\nfrom _collections  import OrderedDict\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt is not incompatible in public exposed APIs so you can close this issue if it is useless.\r\n\r\n## Python Documentation\r\n\r\n- https://github.com/python/cpython/blob/v3.10.0/Objects/odictobject.c\r\n- https://docs.python.org/3/library/collections.html?highlight=ordereddict#collections.OrderedDict","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RustPython/RustPython/issues/3418/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RustPython/RustPython/issues/3418/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}